<item><title>Madagascar targets 5.1% growth in 2027 budget</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-targets-5-1-growth-in-2027-budget-e8ef2f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-targets-5-1-growth-in-2027-budget-e8ef2f/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The plan raises public spending by 11% and relies on higher tax and customs receipts to finance 24 priority programmes.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:11:49 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-targets-5-1-growth-in-2027-budget-e8ef2f/share.jpg" length="39548" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-targets-5-1-growth-in-2027-budget-e8ef2f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Edenia takes Malagasy chocolate to Paris-area Christmas fair</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/edenia-takes-malagasy-chocolate-to-paris-area-christmas-fair-816d85/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/edenia-takes-malagasy-chocolate-to-paris-area-christmas-fair-816d85/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The Madagascar craft chocolatier plans to show about 15 products at the 19 December event organised by ASASOA France-Madagascar.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Madagascar’s armed forces receive 12 drones and qualify 17 military personnel</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-armed-forces-receive-12-drones-and-qualify-17-7922b0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-armed-forces-receive-12-drones-and-qualify-17-7922b0/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The two-week course included 70 flight hours, with the armed forces expected to train future pilots independently.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Madagascar elects Marco Tsaradia as Assembly president with 129 votes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-elects-marco-tsaradia-as-assembly-president-with-c1d40d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-elects-marco-tsaradia-as-assembly-president-with-c1d40d/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The former supporter of Andry Rajoelina won unopposed after other candidates withdrew and Firaisankina deputies left the chamber.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:03:23 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
